  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the curve satisfying the differential equation&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> and passing through <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
